        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483440/extras/4c2d7ef9dacfa27d90b468fefc3bb428.poster.avif?t=1764028031\" width=616 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483440/extras/4c2d7ef9dacfa27d90b468fefc3bb428.webm?t=1764028031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483440/extras/4c2d7ef9dacfa27d90b468fefc3bb428.mp4?t=1764028031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Be charmed by the cute and colorful world of <strong>Shroomtopia</strong>! Relax in this wholesome slow-paced puzzle game while exploring serene landscapes and solving diverse challenges. Manipulate the hexagonal soil and blend the colors. Only you can bring nature back to life!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483440/extras/023632a00e942747d572d1de50405411.poster.avif?t=1764028031\" width=616 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483440/extras/023632a00e942747d572d1de50405411.webm?t=1764028031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483440/extras/023632a00e942747d572d1de50405411.mp4?t=1764028031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Unleash your creativity with a built-in level editor Become a level designer with this intuitive but powerful tool.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483440/extras/1bf3f0257973a6cdf0ee51bad2e84a62.poster.avif?t=1764028031\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483440/extras/1bf3f0257973a6cdf0ee51bad2e84a62.webm?t=1764028031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483440/extras/1bf3f0257973a6cdf0ee51bad2e84a62.mp4?t=1764028031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>And more: <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>🍄 Discover 5 diverse and colorful biomes</strong> <br>A real 2D eye candy full of cute mushroom characters and animated weather effects.<br></li><li>🗺️ <strong>75 levels packed with puzzles gradually increasing in challenge </strong><br>Train your brain through logical problems - can you beat all of them?<br></li><li>🛍️ <strong>Share your designs and play other fan-made maps thanks to the Steam Workshop </strong><br>Upload the newly made creations, share them with your friends and other fans, and get feedback.<br></li><li>🎶 <strong>Relax to the soothing soundtrack made by the indie music producer Felipe Peticov Breathe in, breathe out. </strong><br>What a better way to unwind than these beautiful instrumental sounds?</li></ul></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483440/extras/4c2d7ef9dacfa27d90b468fefc3bb428.poster.avif?t=1764028031\" width=616 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483440/extras/4c2d7ef9dacfa27d90b468fefc3bb428.webm?t=1764028031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483440/extras/4c2d7ef9dacfa27d90b468fefc3bb428.mp4?t=1764028031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Be charmed by the cute and colorful world of <strong>Shroomtopia</strong>! Relax in this wholesome slow-paced puzzle game while exploring serene landscapes and solving diverse challenges. Manipulate the hexagonal soil and blend the colors. Only you can bring nature back to life!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483440/extras/023632a00e942747d572d1de50405411.poster.avif?t=1764028031\" width=616 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483440/extras/023632a00e942747d572d1de50405411.webm?t=1764028031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483440/extras/023632a00e942747d572d1de50405411.mp4?t=1764028031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Unleash your creativity with a built-in level editor Become a level designer with this intuitive but powerful tool.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483440/extras/1bf3f0257973a6cdf0ee51bad2e84a62.poster.avif?t=1764028031\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483440/extras/1bf3f0257973a6cdf0ee51bad2e84a62.webm?t=1764028031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483440/extras/1bf3f0257973a6cdf0ee51bad2e84a62.mp4?t=1764028031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>And more: <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>🍄 Discover 5 diverse and colorful biomes</strong> <br>A real 2D eye candy full of cute mushroom characters and animated weather effects.<br></li><li>🗺️ <strong>75 levels packed with puzzles gradually increasing in challenge </strong><br>Train your brain through logical problems - can you beat all of them?<br></li><li>🛍️ <strong>Share your designs and play other fan-made maps thanks to the Steam Workshop </strong><br>Upload the newly made creations, share them with your friends and other fans, and get feedback.<br></li><li>🎶 <strong>Relax to the soothing soundtrack made by the indie music producer Felipe Peticov Breathe in, breathe out. </strong><br>What a better way to unwind than these beautiful instrumental sounds?</li></ul></p>",
        "short_description": "Be charmed by the cute and colorful world of Shroomtopia! Relax in this wholesome slow-paced puzzle game while exploring serene landscapes and solving diverse challenges. Manipulate the hexagonal soil and blend the colors. Only you can bring nature back to life!",
